    "_%n picture or video of your posts could not be copied here._::_%n pictures or videos of your posts could not be copied here._" : ["Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn lethbhreac de %n dealbh no video dhe na postaichean agad a dhèanamh an-seo.","Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn lethbhreac de %n dhealbh no video dhe na postaichean agad a dhèanamh an-seo.","Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn lethbhreac de %n dealbhan no videothan dhe na postaichean agad a dhèanamh an-seo.","Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn lethbhreac de %n dealbh no video dhe na postaichean agad a dhèanamh an-seo."],
    "_%n picture or video of your posts could not be copied here. Your account is pointed at this server without it: the posts that show it lose it, and it is not copied later._::_%n pictures or videos of your posts could not be copied here. Your account is pointed at this server without them: the posts that show them lose them, and they are not copied later._" : ["Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn lethbhreac de %n dealbh no video dhe na postaichean agad a dhèanamh an-seo. Tha an cunntas agad ’ga stiùireadh dhan fhrithealaiche seo às aonais: caillidh na postaichean a sheallas e e, agus cha tèid lethbhreac a dhèanamh dheth an ceann tamaill.","Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn lethbhreac de %n dhealbh no video dhe na postaichean agad a dhèanamh an-seo. Tha an cunntas agad ’ga stiùireadh dhan fhrithealaiche seo às an aonais: caillidh na postaichean a sheallas iad iad, agus cha tèid lethbhreac a dhèanamh dhiubh an ceann tamaill.","Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn lethbhreac de %n dealbhan no videothan dhe na postaichean agad a dhèanamh an-seo. Tha an cunntas agad ’ga stiùireadh dhan fhrithealaiche seo às an aonais: caillidh na postaichean a sheallas iad iad, agus cha tèid lethbhreac a dhèanamh dhiubh an ceann tamaill.","Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn lethbhreac de %n dealbh no video dhe na postaichean agad a dhèanamh an-seo. Tha an cunntas agad ’ga stiùireadh dhan fhrithealaiche seo às an aonais: caillidh na postaichean a sheallas iad iad, agus cha tèid lethbhreac a dhèanamh dhiubh an ceann tamaill."],
