    "Hidden: no likes, dislikes, boosts or replies are counted for you — on your posts, on anybody else's, and in your phone apps — and other people's profiles show no follower number. Who liked a post is still there to look at, and so is your own follower count." : "Falaichte: cha tèid còrdaidhean, mì-chòrdaidhean, brosnachaidhean no freagairtean a chunntadh dhut — air na postaichean agad, air postaichean dhaoine eile, no sna h-aplacaidean fòn agad — agus cha sheall pròifilean dhaoine eile àireamh an luchd-leantainn. Chì thu fhathast cò às an do chòrd post, agus àireamh an luchd-leantainn agad fhèin.",
