    "_%n view_::_%n views_" : ["%n shealladh","%n shealladh","%n seallaidhean","%n sealladh"],
    "Could not delete your account" : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn an cunntas agad a sguabadh às",
    "Everything you posted from here is deleted, your followers and the people you follow are let go, and every server that knew this account is told it is gone. It cannot be undone, and there is no way to get any of it back afterwards — take an archive from the Export button above first if you might want one." : "Thèid gach rud a phostaich thu às an-seo a sguabadh às, thèid an luchd-leantainn agad is na daoine air a leanas tu a leigeil ma sgaoil, agus thèid innse do gach frithealaiche air an robh an cunntas seo aithnichte gu bheil e air falbh. Cha ghabh seo a neo-dhèanamh, agus chan fhaigh thu dad dheth air ais às a dhèidh — faigh tasg-lann leis a’ phutan Às-phortaich gu h-àrd an toiseach ma dh’fhaoidte gum bi fear a dhìth ort.",
    "Your account on this server was made for Aloha Social, so it is deleted too, and you are signed out. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go." : "Chaidh an cunntas agad air an fhrithealaiche seo a dhèanamh airson Aloha Social, mar sin thèid a sguabadh às cuideachd agus thèid do chlàradh a-mach. Thèid an t-ainm-aithne a tha thu a’ sguabadh às a ghlèidheadh fad uair a thìde ach nach gabh duine eile e cho luath ’s a leigeas tu às e.",
    "Your Nextcloud account is not touched: you stay signed in to everything else, and you can make a new Aloha Social account straight away. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go, so a new account needs a different one." : "Cha tèid beantainn ris a’ chunntas Nextcloud agad: fanaidh tu clàraichte a-steach dhan a h-uile càil eile, agus ’s urrainn dhut cunntas Aloha Social ùr a dhèanamh sa bhad. Thèid an t-ainm-aithne a tha thu a’ sguabadh às a ghlèidheadh fad uair a thìde ach nach gabh duine eile e cho luath ’s a leigeas tu às e, mar sin feumaidh cunntas ùr ainm-aithne eile.",
    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Thèid post a ràinig frithealaiche cuideigin eile mu thràth a sguabadh às le iarraidh air an fhrithealaiche sin a sguabadh às. Nì cha mhòr a h-uile fear sin; chan urrainn dhuinn toirt air gin dhiubh.",
    "Delete my Aloha Social account" : "Sguab às an cunntas Aloha Social agam",
    "Type {handle} to confirm that this is the account you mean." : "Sgrìobh {handle} gus dearbhadh gur e seo an cunntas a tha fa-near dhut.",
    "The handle of the account to delete" : "Ainm-aithne a’ chunntais ri sguabadh às",
    "Delete it for good" : "Sguab às e gu buan",
    "Keep my account" : "Cùm an cunntas agam",
