    "This decides what happens from now on. Replies already posted stay. You can always reply yourself." : "Cuiridh seo romhpa na thachras o seo a-mach. Fanaidh freagairtean a chaidh a phostadh mu thràth. ’S urrainn dhut fhèin freagairt an-còmhnaidh.",
