    "Bluesky's chat service, where direct messages with people on Bluesky are kept: they arrive in Messages here, and a Bluesky app signed in here with an app password that allows them reaches them too. Empty turns direct messages with Bluesky off." : "Seirbheis cabadaich Bluesky, far a bheil teachdaireachdan dìreach le daoine air Bluesky ’gan cumail: ruigidh iad Teachdaireachdan an-seo, is ruigidh aplacaid Bluesky a chlàraich a-steach an-seo le facal-faire aplacaid a cheadaicheas iad iad cuideachd. Ma bhios e falamh, bidh teachdaireachdan dìreach le Bluesky dheth.",
    "Sync ceiling" : "Crìoch an t-sioncronachaidh",
    "How many AppView requests one polling pass may make. Every followed Bluesky account is asked for new posts in turn; the ceiling bounds what a pass costs." : "Co mheud iarrtas AppView a dh’fhaodas aon chuairt cheasnachaidh a dhèanamh. Thèid faighneachd do gach cunntas Bluesky air a bheilear a’ leantainn mu phostaichean ùra fear às dèidh fir; cuingichidh a’ chrìoch na chosgas cuairt.",
    "Trusted Bluesky apps" : "Aplacaidean Bluesky earbsach",
    "Optional. One client ID per line. When one of these apps asks to sign in, the consent page shows its own name and logo; for any other app it shows only the address it is known by, because an app can call itself anything." : "Roghainneil. Aon ID cliant air gach loidhne. Nuair a dh’iarras tè dhe na h-aplacaidean seo clàradh a-steach, seallaidh duilleag a’ chead an t-ainm is an suaicheantas aice fhèin; airson aplacaid sam bith eile, cha seall i ach an seòladh air a bheil i aithnichte, oir faodaidh aplacaid ainm sam bith a ghabhail oirre.",
