    "A shortcode is 2 to 64 characters of a–z, 0–9 and underscore, and the picture is at most 64 KiB. The same rules the command applies, because it is the same code." : "Tha geàrr-chòd eadar 2 is 64 caractar de a–z, 0–9 agus fo-loidhne agus chan eil an dealbh nas motha na 64 KiB. Seo na h-aon riaghailtean a chuireas an àithne an sàs, oir ’s e an aon chòd a th’ ann.",
