    "@{handle} is deleted with everything they posted, and every server that knew the account is told. It cannot be undone." : "Thèid @{handle} a sguabadh às còmhla ris gach rud a phostaich iad agus gheibh gach frithealaiche dham b’ aithne an cunntas fios. Cha ghabh seo a neo-dhèanamh.",
