    "Aloha Social is limited to some groups, and external users are not in them, so they could register and then not open Aloha Social." : "Tha Aloha Social cuingichte ri cuid a bhuidhnean agus chan eil cleachdaichean on taobh a-muigh annta, mar sin b’ urrainn dhaibh clàradh is an uairsin gun Aloha Social fhosgladh.",
