    "Additional registration and privacy information" : "Fiosrachadh a bharrachd mu chlàradh is prìobhaideachd",
    "Shown before people enter their details. Plain text only; adapt this information to your instance. It is not legal advice. When acceptance is required, changing this text creates a new notice version." : "’Ga shealltainn mus cuir daoine a-steach am fiosrachadh aca. Teacsa lom a-mhàin; cuir am fiosrachadh seo an òrdan airson an ionstans agad. Chan e comhairle laghail a th’ ann. Nuair a bhios feum air gabhail ris, cruthaichidh atharrachadh an teacsa seo tionndadh ùr dhen bhrath.",
    "Require registrants to accept this notice" : "Iarr air an fheadhainn a chlàraicheas gabhail ris a’ bhrath seo",
    "The accepted notice version and time are kept with the account until the account is deleted. This records acceptance; it does not make the notice legally sufficient." : "Thèid an tionndadh dhen bhrath ris an deach gabhail agus an t-àm a chumail leis a’ chunntas gus an tèid an cunntas a sguabadh às. Clàraichidh seo gun deach gabhail ris; cha dèan e am brath laghail gu leòr.",
    "Require two-factor authentication" : "Iarr dearbhadh dà-cheumnach",
    "This server requires two-factor authentication of everybody. Switching this off exempts external users." : "Iarraidh am frithealaiche seo dearbhadh dà-cheumnach air a h-uile duine. Ma chuireas tu seo dheth, bidh cleachdaichean on taobh a-muigh saor dheth.",
    "External users then set up an authenticator app or a security key when they first log in. This is Nextcloud's own setting, the same as in Administration → Security." : "Suidhichidh cleachdaichean on taobh a-muigh aplacaid dearbhaidh no iuchair tèarainteachd an uairsin nuair a chlàraicheas iad a-steach an toiseach. Seo roghainn Nextcloud fhèin, an aon tè ’s a tha ann an Rianachd → Tèarainteachd.",
