    "_%n delivery was given up on: that server never got it._::_%n deliveries were given up on: those servers never got them._" : ["Chaidh %n lìbhrigeadh a leigeil seachad: cha d’ fhuair am frithealaiche sin e a-riamh.","Chaidh %n lìbhrigeadh a leigeil seachad: cha d’ fhuair na frithealaichean sin iad a-riamh.","Chaidh %n lìbhrigidhean a leigeil seachad: cha d’ fhuair na frithealaichean sin iad a-riamh.","Chaidh %n lìbhrigeadh a leigeil seachad: cha d’ fhuair na frithealaichean sin iad a-riamh."],
    "_Counted over the last %n day, which is how long a finished delivery is kept._::_Counted over the last %n days, which is how long a finished delivery is kept._" : ["Air a chunntadh thar an %n latha seo chaidh, sin cho fada ’s a thèid lìbhrigeadh deiseil a chumail.","Air a chunntadh thar an %n latha seo chaidh, sin cho fada ’s a thèid lìbhrigeadh deiseil a chumail.","Air a chunntadh thar nan %n làithean seo chaidh, sin cho fada ’s a thèid lìbhrigeadh deiseil a chumail.","Air a chunntadh thar nan %n latha seo chaidh, sin cho fada ’s a thèid lìbhrigeadh deiseil a chumail."],
    "Half-life (days)" : "Leth-bheatha (làithean)",
    "How fast an interest fades when it is no longer read. After this many days a score is worth half." : "Dè cho luath ’s a shìolaidh ùidh nuair nach tèid a leughadh tuilleadh. Às dèidh na h-uimhir seo de làithean, bidh luach leth sgòr.",
    "Listing threshold" : "Stairsneach an liostaidh",
    "The score a learned hashtag needs before it counts as an interest. Lower learns faster and guesses more." : "An sgòr a dh’fheumas taga hais a chaidh ionnsachadh mus cunntar e mar ùidh. Ionnsaichidh luach nas ìsle nas luaithe is nì e barrachd tomhais.",
    "Interests per person" : "Ùidhean gach neach",
    "The most hashtags one person's list holds." : "Na tha de thagaichean hais air liosta neach air a’ char as motha.",
    "Feed window (days)" : "Uinneag an inbhir (làithean)",
    "How far back the feed looks for posts. Longer finds more for rare interests and costs more to rank." : "Dè cho fada air ais ’s a choimheadas an t-inbhir airson postaichean. Lorgaidh nas fhaide barrachd airson ùidhean ainneamh ach cosgaidh e barrachd an rangachadh.",
    "A whole number from {min} to {max}" : "Àireamh shlàn o {min} gu {max}",
    "A number from {min} to {max}" : "Àireamh o {min} gu {max}",
    "Could not save the For you settings" : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn roghainnean Dhut-sa a shàbhaladh",
    "Enable For you" : "Cuir Dhut-sa an comas",
    "Off hides the feed and the settings, and nothing is learned. What was learned is kept, so turning it back on brings everybody's interests back." : "Ma tha e dheth, thèid an t-inbhir is na roghainnean fhalach is cha tèid dad ionnsachadh. Thèid na chaidh ionnsachadh a chumail, mar sin ma chuireas tu air a-rithist e, thig ùidhean gach duine air ais.",
    "Learn from browsing unless a user turns it off" : "Ionnsaich on bhrabhsadh mura cuir cleachdaiche dheth e",
    "The GDPR-relevant choice: off makes learning opt-in, and each person is invited to turn it on. A user's own choice always wins." : "An roghainn a bhuineas ri GDPR: ma tha e dheth, feumaidh daoine roghnachadh airson ionnsachadh, is gheibh gach neach cuireadh a chur air. Buannaichidh roghainn a’ chleachdaiche fhèin an-còmhnaidh.",
    "Could not load the refused files" : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn na faidhlichean a chaidh a dhiùltadh a luchdadh",
    "Could not refuse that file" : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn am faidhle sin a dhiùltadh",
    "Could not allow that file again" : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn am faidhle sin a cheadachadh a-rithist",
    "Checksum (sha256)" : "Checksum (sha256)",
    "Why, for whoever reads this next year" : "Carson, airson cò sam bith a leughas seo an ath-bhliadhna",
    "Refuse this file" : "Diùlt am faidhle seo",
    "The checksum of a file is what sha256sum prints for it. It matches that exact file: a re-encoded or re-cropped copy is a different file and is not caught." : "’S e checksum faidhle na chlò-bhuaileas sha256sum air a shon. Freagraidh e ris an dearbh fhaidhle sin: ’s e faidhle eile a th’ ann an lethbhreac a chaidh ath-chòdachadh no ath-bhearradh is cha tèid a ghlacadh.",
