    "Go to Aloha Social app" : "Tadhail air aplacaid Aloha Social",
    "_One account could not be reached from this server:_::_%n accounts could not be reached from this server:_" : ["Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn %n chunntas a ruigsinn on fhrithealaiche seo:","Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn %n chunntas a ruigsinn on fhrithealaiche seo:","Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn %n cunntasan a ruigsinn on fhrithealaiche seo:","Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn %n cunntas a ruigsinn on fhrithealaiche seo:"],
