    "Packs" : "Pasgain",
    "Pictures" : "Dealbhan",
    "Tags" : "Tagaichean",
    "Could not open this pack. The server may be busy." : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn a’ phacaid seo fhosgladh. Dh’fhaoidte gu bheil am frithealaiche trang.",
