    "All starter packs" : "Gach pacaid tòiseachaidh",
    "Their server did not answer. Often it is only busy for a moment. If this Nextcloud cannot be reached from the internet, some servers never answer it." : "Cha do fhreagair am frithealaiche aca. Gu tric chan eil e ach trang airson greiseag. Mur gabh an Nextcloud seo ruigsinn on eadar-lìon, cha fhreagair cuid a fhrithealaichean e idir.",
    "No starter packs" : "Chan eil pacaid tòiseachaidh ann",
    "Your island and its neighbours" : "An t-eilean agad is a choimhearsnaich",
    "Every server in the fediverse is an island. Following somebody on another one opens a canoe route to it, and their posts travel to you along that route." : "’S e eilean a th’ anns gach frithealaiche sa Fediverse. Ma leanas tu air cuideigin air fear eile, fosglaidh sin slighe curaich thuige, agus siubhlaidh na postaichean aca thugad air an t-slighe sin.",
    "Search the fediverse" : "Lorg sa Fediverse",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org or @someone.example.com, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Ainmean is ainmean-aithne ann an eòlairean poblach, nam measg daoine air frithealaichean air nach do thachair am fear seo a-riamh. Lorgar cuideigin nach eil air an liosta leis an ainm-aithne shlàn aca, mar @someone@example.org no @someone.example.com, san raon-luirg aig bàrr a’ bhàir-thaoibh.",
    "Names and handles in public directories, including people on servers this one has never met. Somebody who is not listed is found by their full handle, like @someone@example.org, in the search at the top of the sidebar." : "Ainmean is ainmean-aithne ann an eòlairean poblach, nam measg daoine air frithealaichean air nach do thachair am fear seo a-riamh. Lorgar cuideigin nach eil air an liosta leis an ainm-aithne shlàn aca, mar @someone@example.org, san raon-luirg aig bàrr a’ bhàir-thaoibh.",
    "Because of who you follow" : "Air sàillibh cò air a leanas tu",
    "The people you follow follow other people. This asks their servers who, and puts the ones several of them share first." : "Leanaidh na daoine air a leanas tu air daoine eile. Faighnichidh seo de na frithealaichean aca cò, agus cuiridh e an fheadhainn a tha aig grunnan dhiubh an toiseach.",
    "Suggested on Bluesky" : "Air a mholadh air Bluesky",
    "People Bluesky suggests to you, from who you follow there. Follow them here like anybody else." : "Daoine a mholas Bluesky dhut, a-rèir cò air a leanas tu an-sin. Lean orra an-seo mar air duine sam bith eile.",
    "People this server knows" : "Daoine as aithne dhan fhrithealaiche seo",
    "Accounts on this Nextcloud, and the ones it has met through the people here." : "Cunntasan air an Nextcloud seo, agus an fheadhainn ris an do choinnich e tro na daoine an-seo.",
    "On your Nextcloud" : "Air an Nextcloud agad",
    "Nobody here yet" : "Chan eil duine an-seo fhathast",
    "Accounts this server has met will appear here. Until it has met any, the search above asks other servers’ directories instead." : "Nochdaidh na cunntasan ris an do choinnich am frithealaiche seo an-seo. Gus an coinnich e ri gin, faighnichidh an lorg gu h-àrd de dh’eòlairean fhrithealaichean eile na àite.",
    "Failed to load follow requests" : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn na h-iarrtasan leantainn a luchdadh",
    "Failed to accept the follow request" : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn gabhail ris an iarrtas leantainn",
