    "No pending follow requests" : "Chan eil iarrtas leantainn ri dhèiligeadh",
    "When your account is locked, people asking to follow you show up here." : "Nuair a bhios an cunntas agad glaiste, nochdaidh daoine a dh’iarras leantainn ort an-seo.",
    "Change that in your account settings." : "Atharraich sin ann an roghainnean a’ chunntais agad.",
    "Load more" : "Luchdaich barrachd",
    "Your account is yours. Take a copy of it whenever you like, move it to another server, or bring one here from somewhere else — including the posts you wrote there, with their pictures." : "’S ann agadsa a tha an cunntas agad. Dèan lethbhreac dheth uair sam bith a thogras tu, imrich e gu frithealaiche eile, no thoir fear an-seo o àite eile — a’ gabhail a-steach nam postaichean a sgrìobh thu an-sin, le an dealbhan.",
    "Page not found" : "Cha deach an duilleag a lorg",
