    "Authorized" : "Air ùghdarrachadh",
    "Paste this code into {appDisplayName} to finish signing in. It can be used once, and only by the application that asked for it." : "Cuir an còd seo ann an {appDisplayName} gus crìoch a chur air a’ chlàradh a-steach. Gabhaidh a chleachdadh aon turas, agus leis an aplacaid a dh’iarr e a-mhàin.",
    "Authorization code" : "Còd ùghdarrachaidh",
