    "Set up your account" : "Suidhich an cunntas agad",
    "{appDisplayName} wants to sign in to your account here, and you do not have one yet. Choose your username first; then you decide whether to let {appDisplayName} in." : "Tha {appDisplayName} airson clàradh a-steach dhan chunntas agad an-seo, agus chan eil fear agad fhathast. Tagh an t-ainm-cleachdaiche agad an toiseach; an uairsin co-dhùinidh tu an leig thu {appDisplayName} a-steach.",
    "Your account is ready. Taking you on to {appDisplayName}…" : "Tha an cunntas agad deiseil. ’Gad thoirt air adhart gu {appDisplayName}…",
    "Authorization required" : "Tha feum air ùghdarrachadh",
    "An app this server's administrator vouches for, by this address." : "Aplacaid a tha rianaire an fhrithealaiche seo a’ dol an urras oirre, leis an t-seòladh seo.",
    "This address is what the app is known by; its name is not checked." : "Seo an seòladh air a bheil an aplacaid aithnichte; cha dèid an t-ainm aice a dhearbhadh.",
