    "Continue" : "Lean air adhart",
    "Could not find your server from that address. Check the name@domain and try again." : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn am frithealaiche agad a lorg on t-seòladh sin. Thoir sùil air an ainm@àrainn agus feuch ris a-rithist.",
    "This step is needed as the user is probably not registered on the same server as you are. We will redirect you to your homeserver to follow this account." : "Tha feum air a’ cheum seo a chionn ’s nach eil an cleachdaiche clàraichte air an aon fhrithealaiche riutsa, ’s mathaid. Cuiridh sinn air adhart thu dhan fhrithealaiche dachaigh agad gus leantainn air a’ chunntas seo.",
