    "Public posts that were taken here, as their posters said. A place is never worked out from a picture — it is only ever what somebody chose to say." : "Postaichean poblach a chaidh a thogail an-seo, mar a thuirt an luchd-postaidh aca. Cha dèid àite obrachadh a-mach à dealbh uair sam bith — chan eil ann ach na roghnaich cuideigin a ràdh.",
