    "Hashtags shown under your bio. Anyone can click one to read what you posted with it." : "Tagaichean hais a chithear fon eachdraidh-beatha agad. ’S urrainn do dhuine sam bith briogadh air fear gus na phostaich thu leis a leughadh.",
    "Portfolio" : "Pasgan-obrach",
    "A public page with the photos you choose and its own address, for a CV or a website. Only public photos can be on it." : "Duilleag phoblach leis na dealbhan a thaghas tu agus seòladh dhi fhèin, airson CV no làrach-lìn. Chan fhaod ach dealbhan poblach a bhith oirre.",
    "The hashtags your For you feed is made of, learned from what you read. Only you see this." : "Na tagaichean hais às a bheil an t-inbhir Dhutsa agad air a dhèanamh, air an ionnsachadh o na leughas tu. Chan fhaic duine seo ach thusa.",
    "A list is a few of the people you follow, read as a timeline of its own. Your lists are in the sidebar." : "’S e liosta cuid dhe na daoine air a leanas tu, air an leughadh mar loidhne-ama dhi fhèin. Tha na liostaichean agad sa bhàr-taoibh.",
    "Custom feeds and lists from Bluesky, read here as timelines of their own. A Bluesky app signed in to this account keeps the same ones." : "Inbhirean gnàthaichte is liostaichean o Bluesky, air an leughadh an-seo mar loidhnichean-ama dhaibh fhèin. Cumaidh aplacaid Bluesky a tha clàraichte a-steach dhan chunntas seo an fheadhainn cheudna.",
    "How pictures and videos their author marked sensitive are shown to you." : "Mar a thèid dealbhan is videothan a chomharraich an ùghdar mar frionasach a shealltainn dhut.",
