    "Whether you see how many likes, boosts, replies and followers posts and people have. Off unless you turn it on." : "Am faic thu co mheud còrdadh, brosnachadh, freagairt is neach-leantainn a tha aig postaichean is daoine. Dheth mura cuir thu air e.",
    "Looking back" : "A’ coimhead air ais",
    "A short note about your week at the top of your feed, next to your posts from this day in earlier years." : "Nòta goirid mun t-seachdain agad aig barr an inbhir agad, ri taobh nam postaichean agad on latha seo sna bliadhnaichean roimhe.",
    "Sound and touch" : "Fuaim is suathadh",
    "Small confirmations you hear or feel. They are kept on this device only, so a laptop at work can stay quiet while your phone taps back." : "Dearbhaidhean beaga a chluinneas no a dh’fhairicheas tu. Cha tèid an cumail ach air an uidheam seo, ach am fan laptop aig an obair sàmhach fhad ’s a bhios am fòn agad a’ toirt gnogag air ais.",
    "Right away or in a digest, and the hours to stay quiet." : "Sa bhad no ann an geàrr-chunntas, agus na h-uairean airson fuireach sàmhach.",
    "Whose posts, likes and follows reach you right away, and whose wait for you to look." : "Cò aig a bheil na postaichean, na còrdaidhean is an leantainn a ruigeas thu sa bhad, agus cò aca a dh’fhuiricheas gus an coimhead thu.",
    "Scheduled posts" : "Postaichean air an sgeideal",
    "What you have written to be published later. Move one to another time or cancel it here." : "Na sgrìobh thu airson fhoillseachadh às a dhèidh. Gluais fear gu àm eile no sguir dheth an-seo.",
    "Waiting for review" : "A’ feitheamh air lèirmheas",
    "Posts a moderator looks at before they go out, such as the first post of a new account. You can take one back." : "Postaichean air an coimhead maor mus tèid iad a-mach, can a’ chiad phost aig cunntas ùr. ’S urrainn dhut fear a thoirt air ais.",
    "Archived posts" : "Postaichean san tasg-lann",
    "Posts you put away. They are off your profile and your timelines here, but not deleted on other servers. Put one back any time." : "Postaichean a chuir thu air falbh. Chan eil iad air a’ phròifil no air na loidhnichean-ama agad an-seo, ach cha deach an sguabadh às air frithealaichean eile. Cuir fear air ais uair sam bith.",
    "Replies in Files" : "Freagairtean ann am Faidhlichean",
    "A picture you post from Files keeps a link to its file. Replies to the post can be read in the file's Comments tab, next to the picture they are about." : "Cumaidh dealbh a phostas tu o Fhaidhlichean ceangal ris an fhaidhle aige. Gabhaidh freagairtean dhan phost a leughadh ann an taba nam beachdan aig an fhaidhle, ri taobh an deilbh air a bheil iad.",
    "Authorized apps" : "Aplacaidean ùghdarraichte",
    "Apps signed in to your account, such as a phone client. Sign out the ones you no longer use, or all of them after losing a phone." : "Aplacaidean a tha clàraichte a-steach dhan chunntas agad, can cliant fòn. Clàraich a-mach an fheadhainn nach cleachd thu tuilleadh, no iad uile às dèidh dhut fòn a chall.",
    "This account is also reachable on Bluesky, because this server offers one." : "Gabhaidh an cunntas seo a ruigsinn air Bluesky cuideachd, a chionn ’s gu bheil am frithealaiche seo a’ toirt seachad fear.",
    "Invite people" : "Thoir cuireadh do dhaoine",
    "A link somebody without an account can use to register on this server. Each link works once and for a week." : "Ceangal as urrainn do chuideigin gun chunntas a chleachdadh gus clàradh air an fhrithealaiche seo. Obraichidh gach ceangal aon turas agus fad seachdain.",
    "Your storage" : "An stòras agad",
    "The pictures and videos you uploaded here, against what this server lets each account keep. Media from other servers does not count." : "Na dealbhan is videothan a luchdaich thu suas an-seo, an aghaidh na leigeas am frithealaiche seo le gach cunntas a chumail. Chan eil meadhanan o fhrithealaichean eile a’ cunntadh.",
    "Delete your Aloha Social account" : "Sguab às an cunntas Aloha Social agad",
    "Your account on this server and everything you posted. This cannot be undone." : "An cunntas agad air an fhrithealaiche seo agus gach rud a phostaich thu. Cha ghabh seo a neo-dhèanamh.",
    "Your fediverse account and everything you posted. Your Nextcloud account stays as it is. This cannot be undone." : "An cunntas Fediverse agad agus gach rud a phostaich thu. Fanaidh an cunntas Nextcloud agad mar a tha e. Cha ghabh seo a neo-dhèanamh.",
    "Introduction" : "Ro-ràdh",
    "The four steps shown when your account was new: your address, people to follow, and the follows you had on another server." : "Na ceithir ceuman a chaidh a shealltainn nuair a bha an cunntas agad ùr: an seòladh agad, daoine air an leantainn, agus an leantainn a bh’ agad air frithealaiche eile.",
    "The keys this app listens for while you are reading, and the switch that turns them off." : "Na h-iuchraichean ris an èist an aplacaid seo fhad ’s a tha thu a’ leughadh, agus an suids a chuireas dheth iad.",
