    "Join {domain}. Your account can be used for Aloha Social, and nothing else on this server. An administrator looks at every registration before it becomes an account." : "Gabh pàirt ann an {domain}. Gabhaidh an cunntas agad a chleachdadh airson Aloha Social, is chan ann airson dad eile air an fhrithealaiche seo. Coimheadaidh rianaire air gach clàradh mus fàs e na chunntas.",
