    "An Aloha Social account" : "Cunntas Aloha Social",
    "This account is for Aloha Social only. It does not give you access to Files, Talk, WebDAV or other Nextcloud apps on this server." : "Tha an cunntas seo airson Aloha Social a-mhàin. Cha toir e cothrom dhut air Faidhlichean, Talk, WebDAV no aplacaidean Nextcloud eile air an fhrithealaiche seo.",
    "This server requires two-factor authentication. You will need to set it up when you first sign in." : "Tha am frithealaiche seo ag iarraidh dearbhadh dà-cheumnach. Feumaidh tu a shuidheachadh a’ chiad turas a chlàraicheas tu a-steach.",
    "After joining, you can finish the introduction, find people and any starter packs this server offers, write posts, and manage your profile and account settings. If you have an export from a compatible service, you can import your follow list." : "Às dèidh dhut pàirt a ghabhail, ’s urrainn dhut crìoch a chur air an ro-ràdh, daoine a lorg agus pacaidean tòiseachaidh sam bith a tha am frithealaiche seo a’ tairgsinn, postaichean a sgrìobhadh, agus a’ phròifil is roghainnean a’ chunntais agad a stiùireadh. Ma tha às-phortadh agad o sheirbheis chò-chòrdail, ’s urrainn dhut liosta an leantainn agad ion-phortadh.",
    "Public posts may be delivered to other servers. Other servers may keep copies, so deleting a post here cannot guarantee that every copy elsewhere is removed." : "Dh’fhaoidte gun tèid postaichean poblach a lìbhrigeadh gu frithealaichean eile. Dh’fhaoidte gun cùm frithealaichean eile lethbhreacan, mar sin chan urrainn do sguabadh às puist an-seo barantachadh gun tèid gach lethbhreac ann an àite eile a thoirt air falbh.",
