    "Reach is an estimate: your followers today, plus the followers of everybody who boosted the post. Audiences that overlap are counted twice, and nobody can count the people who saw a post without touching it." : "’S e tuairmse a th’ anns an ruigse: an luchd-leantainn agad an-diugh, agus luchd-leantainn gach duine a bhrosnaich am post. Thèid luchd-èisteachd a tha a’ dol thar a chèile a chunntadh dà thuras, agus chan urrainn do dhuine na daoine a chunnaic post gun bhuntainn ris a chunntadh.",
    "_The audience of one account that boosted you is not known here, and counts as nobody._::_The audiences of {count} accounts that boosted you are not known here, and count as nobody._" : ["Chan eil fios an-seo air luchd-èisteachd {count} chunntais a bhrosnaich thu, agus cha chunntar e idir.","Chan eil fios an-seo air luchd-èisteachd {count} chunntais a bhrosnaich thu, agus cha chunntar iad idir.","Chan eil fios an-seo air luchd-èisteachd {count} cunntasan a bhrosnaich thu, agus cha chunntar iad idir.","Chan eil fios an-seo air luchd-èisteachd {count} cunntas a bhrosnaich thu, agus cha chunntar iad idir."],
