    "When your posts do best" : "Cuin a nì na postaichean agad as fheàrr",
    "Not enough posts at any one hour to say yet — it takes three in the same hour before this is more than luck." : "Chan eil postaichean gu leòr aig aon uair sam bith airson a ràdh fhathast — feumaidh trì san aon uair mus bi seo nas motha na fortan.",
