    "Average engagement of a post carrying the tag. Tags used once are left out: one post that did well is a post that did well." : "Com-pàirteachas cuibheasach puist sa bheil an taga. Thèid tagaichean a chaidh a chleachdadh aon turas fhàgail às: ’s e post a rinn gu math a th’ ann am post a rinn gu math.",
