    "Where the engagement comes from" : "Cò às a thig an conaltradh",
    "Likes, boosts and replies, by the server of whoever made them. {n}% came from accounts on this server." : "Còrdaidhean, brosnachaidhean is freagairtean, a-rèir frithealaiche an neach a rinn iad. Thàinig {n}% o chunntasan air an fhrithealaiche seo.",
