    "How the fediverse has grown" : "Mar a dh’fhàs a’ Fediverse",
    "Accounts, month by month" : "Cunntasan, mìos air mhìos",
    "A step in this line is usually the survey reaching servers it had not reached before, rather than the network changing size — so no year-on-year figure is shown for a year that has one in it." : "Mar as trice, ’s e ceum san loidhne seo an suirbhidh a’ ruigsinn fhrithealaichean nach do ràinig e roimhe, seach meud an lìonraidh ag atharrachadh — mar sin cha tèid àireamh bliadhna air bhliadhna a shealltainn airson bliadhna sa bheil fear.",
    "What you did" : "Na rinn thu",
    "Everything above counts what came back to you. This counts what you did: a quiet month here is a month you did not post, not a month nobody answered." : "Cunntaidh gach rud gu h-àrd na thàinig air ais thugad. Cunntaidh seo na rinn thu: ’s e mìos sàmhach an-seo mìos nach do phostaich thu, chan e mìos nach do fhreagair duine.",
    "How steadily you post" : "Cho cunbhalach ’s a phostas tu",
