    "longest quiet spell" : "an ùine shàmhach as fhaide",
    "Who you talk with" : "Cò ris a bhruidhneas tu",
    "From the replies rather than from who you follow. The two are rarely the same list." : "Às na freagairtean seach cò air a leanas tu. Is ainneamh a tha an dà liosta co-ionnan.",
