    "A picture without a description is a picture nobody using a screen reader can read. This is the one number on the page you can move on your own." : "Dealbh gun tuairisgeul, ’s e dealbh a th’ ann nach urrainn do neach sam bith a chleachdas leughadair-sgrìn a leughadh. Seo an aon àireamh air an duilleag as urrainn dhut atharrachadh leat fhèin.",
