    "Local timeline" : "Loidhne-ama ionadail",
    "Global timeline" : "Loidhne-ama uile-choitcheann",
    "Home timeline" : "Loidhne-ama na dachaigh",
    "Mentions" : "Iomraidhean",
    "Favourites" : "Annsachdan",
    "Polls" : "Cunntasan-bheachd",
    "Edits" : "Deasachaidhean",
    "Which posts to show" : "Dè na postaichean a thèid a shealltainn",
    "You can now choose who reaches your notifications — new accounts and people you don't follow can wait for your review." : "’S urrainn dhut taghadh a-nis cò ruigeas na brathan agad — faodaidh cunntasan ùra is daoine air nach lean thu feitheamh ris an lèirmheas agad.",
    "Choose in Settings" : "Tagh sna roghainnean",
    "Mark all as read" : "Cuir comharra gun deach na h-uile a leughadh",
    "Which activities to show" : "Dè a’ ghnìomhachd a thèid a shealltainn",
    "_{count} person is waiting — Review_::_{count} people are waiting — Review_" : ["Tha {count} neach a’ feitheamh — Dèan lèirmheas","Tha {count} neach a’ feitheamh — Dèan lèirmheas","Tha {count} daoine a’ feitheamh — Dèan lèirmheas","Tha {count} neach a’ feitheamh — Dèan lèirmheas"],
    "_%n new activity_::_%n new activities_" : ["%n ghnìomhachd ùr","%n ghnìomhachd ùr","%n gnìomhachdan ùra","%n gnìomhachd ùr"],
    "_%n reply is not shown here. It may be from an account you blocked or muted, or from a server this one has not heard from._::_%n replies are not shown here. They may be from accounts you blocked or muted, or from servers this one has not heard from._" : ["Chan eil %n fhreagairt ’ga sealltainn an-seo. Dh’fhaoidte gu bheil i o chunntas a bhac no a mhùch thu, no o fhrithealaiche nach cuala am fear seo uaithe.","Chan eil %n fhreagairt ’gan sealltainn an-seo. Dh’fhaoidte gu bheil iad o chunntasan a bhac no a mhùch thu, no o fhrithealaichean nach cuala am fear seo uapa.","Chan eil %n freagairtean ’gan sealltainn an-seo. Dh’fhaoidte gu bheil iad o chunntasan a bhac no a mhùch thu, no o fhrithealaichean nach cuala am fear seo uapa.","Chan eil %n freagairt ’gan sealltainn an-seo. Dh’fhaoidte gu bheil iad o chunntasan a bhac no a mhùch thu, no o fhrithealaichean nach cuala am fear seo uapa."],
    "Post by {name}" : "Post le {name}",
    "Could not load this post" : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn am post seo a luchdadh",
    "Your connection or this server may be having trouble." : "Dh’fhaoidte gu bheil duilgheadas aig a’ cheangal agad no aig an fhrithealaiche seo.",
    "This post is not available" : "Chan eil am post seo ri fhaighinn",
    "It may have been deleted, or this server never received it." : "Dh’fhaoidte gun deach a sguabadh às, no nach d’ fhuair am frithealaiche seo e a-riamh.",
    "_Show %n reply hidden by the author_::_Show %n replies hidden by the author_" : ["Seall %n fhreagairt a dh’fhalaich an t-ùghdar","Seall %n fhreagairt a dh’fhalaich an t-ùghdar","Seall %n freagairtean a dh’fhalaich an t-ùghdar","Seall %n freagairt a dh’fhalaich an t-ùghdar"],
    "Videos, one at a time" : "Videothan, fear mu seach",
    "Hold this short" : "Cùm an geàrr-chlàr seo",
    "The picture of this short is gone." : "Tha dealbh a’ gheàrr-chlàir seo air falbh.",
    "Unlike" : "Na còrdadh e rium tuilleadh",
    "Tap for sound" : "Thoir gnogag airson fuaim",
    "Open the post" : "Fosgail am post",
    "Loading videos …" : "A’ luchdadh nan videothan …",
    "The videos could not be loaded." : "Cha b’ urrainn dhuinn na videothan a luchdadh.",
    "No shorts here yet." : "Chan eil geàrr-chlàr an-seo fhathast.",
    "A short is a video of up to three minutes, upright or square." : "’S e video suas ri trì mionaidean a th’ ann an geàrr-chlàr, ’na sheasamh no ceàrnagach.",
    "Back to Videos" : "Air ais gu Videothan",
    "Whose videos" : "Cò leis na videothan",
    "These figures are for the fediverse only. {networks} publishes no count of its accounts that could be quoted here, so it is not included." : "Tha na h-àireamhan seo airson an fediverse a-mhàin. Chan fhoillsich {networks} cunntas sam bith air na cunntasan aige a ghabhadh luaidh an-seo, mar sin chan eil e ’na lùib.",
    "Translated by {provider}" : "Air eadar-theangachadh le {provider}",
    "One step is left, on your old server: tell it to move your followers here. On Mastodon that is Preferences → Account → Move to a different account; enter {handle} there." : "Tha aon cheum air fhàgail, air an t-seann fhrithealaiche agad: iarr air an luchd-leantainn agad a ghluasad an-seo. Air Mastodon, ’s e Roghainnean → Cunntas → Imrich gu cunntas eile a th’ ann; cuir a-steach {handle} an sin.",
    "The latest change was made on {date}. Until {until}, it can still be undone by: {keys}." : "Chaidh an t-atharrachadh as ùire a dhèanamh air {date}. Gu ruige {until}, ’s urrainn dha seo a neo-dhèanamh fhathast: {keys}.",
