    "The posts of the people and hashtags you follow. Not your lists: a list timeline is never filtered." : "Postaichean nan daoine is nan tagaichean hais air a leanas tu. Chan e na liostaichean agad: cha tèid loidhne-ama liosta a chriathradh idir.",
